ame":"combee-formula-0-offline-ace","reference":{"code":"https://github.com/ace-agent/ace","deviations":["Common-condition Combee/ACE Formula study; not a reproduction of published scores.","Uses the pinned ACE Formula 500/300/200 files; the Combee paper reports 250 training samples. The exact paper subset was not established, so this study does not invent that selection.","Each seed/mode uses identical actors, data, initial playbook and hard budget ceilings across variants; actual calls, cost and elapsed time can differ and are reported separately.","Managed fresh chat roles and bounded parallel trials; transport failures stop without synthetic scores or unbounded retries.","Naive parallel uses the same batch sample learner with one curation pass, no duplication and no reducer.","ACE retains its reference serial loop; batched variants retain ACEBatch's update and boundary-validation rules. Validation counts may differ by batch size and are reported, not silently equalized.","Dynamic profiling uses ordinary training and measured local wall time; interrupted durations stay unknown.","End-to-end elapsed time includes baseline, optimization, validation, final evaluation and persistence; it excludes preparation and report auditing and is not summed worker time or paper training latency."],"evidence":[],"paper":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.04247","profile":"adapted","revision":"82709de050e1db6e6ef2f07bcb0393560b94992a","schema_version":1,"status":"experimental"},"schema_version":1,"search":{},"seed":0,"stages":[{"budget":{"max_concurrency":1,"max_cost_usd":null,"max_evaluations":null,"max_model_calls":null,"max_wall_seconds":null,"schema_version":1},"evidence":null,"failure_policy":"stop","id":"reflect","input_types":{"request":"proteus.ace.reflection_input@1"},"knowledge":[],"max_attempts":1,"operator":{"options":{"schema_version":1},"plugin":{"name":"proteus.ace_reflect","schema_version":1,"version":"1"},"requires":[],"schema_version":1},"output_types":{"reflection":"pr